* YEKVO D1.4 - 8051 Open-Drain GPIO & Pull-Up Sweep (Teaching Model Only)
VDD vdd 0 DC 5

* Pulsa Gate: t=0..5u Vin=5V (NMOS ON -> Output LOW), t>=5u Vin=0V (NMOS OFF -> Output naik ke HIGH)
VIN in 0 PULSE(5 0 5u 2n 2n 60u 120u)

* 1. Rangkaian Open-Drain NMOS + Pull-Up Eksternal
MN out in 0 0 NM W=20u L=1u
RP vdd out 1k
CL out 0 20p

* 2. Pembanding Konseptual: Push-Pull Ideal (CMOS Inverter)
MP_pp out_pp in vdd vdd PM W=20u L=1u
MN_pp out_pp in 0 0 NM W=10u L=1u
CL_pp out_pp 0 20p

.model NM NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.8 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model PM PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.8 KP=50u LAMBDA=0.02)

.control
* Jalankan 9 kombinasi R_pullup (1k, 4.7k, 10k) x C_load (20p, 100p, 1n)
foreach rval 1k 4.7k 10k
  alter rp = $rval
  foreach cval 20p 100p 1n
    alter cl = $cval
    alter cl_pp = $cval
    tran 2n 65u
    let isink = i(VDD)
    wrdata results/gpio_r{$rval}_c{$cval}.csv v(out) isink v(out_pp)
  end
end

* Fault Test: Tanpa Pull-Up (Floating Node, R=1T Ohm agar matriks SPICE konvergen)
alter rp = 1e12
alter cl = 20p
alter cl_pp = 20p
tran 2n 65u
let isink = i(VDD)
wrdata results/gpio_floating.csv v(out) isink v(out_pp)

quit
.endc
.end